{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45903","headline":"送吏部刘相公除东川 · 贯休","name":"送吏部刘相公除东川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝念梓州民，年年战仗频。\n山川无草木，烽火没烟尘。\n政乱皆因乱，安人必藉仁。\n皇天开白日，殷鼎辍诚臣。\n一日离君侧，千官送渭滨。\n酒倾红琥珀，马控白骐驎。\n渥泽番番降，壶浆处处陈。\n旌幢山色湿，邛僰鸟啼新。\n帟幕还名俭，良医始姓秦。\n军雄城似岳，地变物含春。\n白必侵双鬓，清应诫四邻。\n吾皇重命相，更合是何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}